SUMMARY:LEGO Robotics-4-week Course
DESCRIPTION:Young engineers will build\, code\, and bring their creations to life in this exciting hands-on robotics program! Using LEGO® robotics kits\, students explore the fundamentals of engineering\, programming\, and problem-solving while designing robots that can move and respond to commands. With small classes\, there’s individual attention while students are developing critical STEM skills while playing. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
