SUMMARY:Kinetic Bots
DESCRIPTION:In Kinetic Bots\, students design\, build\, and program robots to navigate obstacle courses\, complete missions\, and overcome unexpected engineering challenges. Through artsy trial and error\, kids learn how sensors\, motors\, and coding work together while strengthening critical thinking\, perseverance\, and creative problem-solving skills. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
