SUMMARY:The Sealing Ceremony: Letters to 2076
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by The Traveling Diary and Howe House. \nJoin the Montclair community as we come together to seal the Montclair Community Time Capsule and preserve our collective stories for the next 50 years. The ceremony will celebrate the letters\, photographs\, artwork\, and mementos contributed by community members throughout 2026. Together\, we’ll mark this special moment in time and send a piece of today’s Montclair into the future\, where it will be opened in 2076. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/the-sealing-ceremony-letters-to-2076/
