SUMMARY:Garden State Roller Derby Last Bout of 20th Anniversary Season against Jersey Shore
DESCRIPTION:Garden State Roller Derby (GSR)\, New Jersey’s premiere flat track roller derby league\, will host its final bout of the 2026 season\, facing off against Jersey Shore Roller Derby at 6 p.m. on Sat.\, Nov. 14\, at the Inline Skating Club of America in North Arlington\, NJ. Tickets are on sale now at events.ticketleap.com/events/gsrderby. Derby fans and first-timers alike can watch the exciting\, family-friendly\, full-contact smackdown as Garden State Roller Derby’s Brick City Bruisers take on Jersey Shore Roller Derby. \nAdult tickets are $20 at the door or $16.30 in advance if purchased online at GSR’s Ticketleap page. Children under 12 are half price\, under 4 are free. Fans can also shop GSR merchandise and enjoy a bake sale and raffles throughout the event\, with 100% of proceeds benefitting Northern New Jersey’s only volunteer-run flat track roller derby league. \nThe bout will cap off a strong year of growth for the Brick City Bruisers\, who have welcomed several new transfers alongside a formidable class of incoming “fresh meat” from GSR’s new skater training program to join a dedicated cohort of veteran GSR teammates. Under the leadership of GSR’s coaching committee and with mentorship from Garden State’s All-Star Ironbound Maidens traveling A-team\, the Bruisers have consistently worked hard to level up their gameplay throughout the 2026 season and compete at an advanced level against travel teams fielded by top roller derby leagues across the tri-state and beyond. \nThe Nov. 14 bout marks the end of GSR’s 20th anniversary season–don’t miss your last chance to celebrate 20 years of the biggest action on the smallest wheels in Northern New Jersey! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/garden-state-roller-derby-last-bout-of-20th-anniversary-season-against-jersey-shore/
LOCATION:Inline Skating Club of America\, 170 Schuyler Ave\, North Arlington\, NJ\, 07031\, United States
CATEGORIES:Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bruisers_vs_Jersey_Shore_Oct_flyer.png
