SUMMARY:Feel the Power of Mendelssohn's "Elijah"
DESCRIPTION:The Oratorio Society of New Jersey (OSNJ) will perform Felix Mendelssohn’s Elijah on Saturday\, November 14\, at 7:30 pm at Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair.\nMendelssohn’s Elijah is a wonderful\, dramatic work sure to please audiences. If you like Handel’s Messiah\, Beethoven’s Ninth\, or the works of Bach\, the power and passion of Elijah is sure to move you.\nTickets are $30 in advance and $35 at the door – plus OSNJ offers student pricing: $15 in advance\, $20 at the door.\nDoors open at 7:00pm for the 7:30pm performance – please arrive early due to General Admission seating. For more information and to purchase tickets online\, visit the Oratorio Society of New Jersey website at https://www.oratoriosocietynj.org/. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/feel-the-power-of-mendelssohns-elijah/
LOCATION:Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
