SUMMARY:NJBS Blues & Brews: Dean Shot & His Solid Senders IBC Fundraiser at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the next installment of our monthly collab with the North Jersey Blues Society known as Blues + Brews. One Sunday a month\, we collaborate to bring the Blues to Montclair. Next up – Dean Shot & His Solid Senders! \nA true expert of his craft with over 30 years of experience and having cut his teeth playing with legends such as Hubert Sumlin\, Danny Russo\, Paul Oscher\, Floyd Phillips\, and more\, Dean is no stranger to the real deal blues. He can deliver it with a power and deftness that few have ever matched. \n$10 cover charge per person that goes directly to the band supporting their chance to compete in The Blues Foundation’s International Blues Challenge. \nThe mission of the North Jersey Blues Society is to celebrate the heritage of blues music through the unity of fans\, musicians\, society members\, venues\, and business owners who will collaborate and promote the blues in Northern New Jersey. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
