SUMMARY:Holiday Boutique at Van Vleck House
DESCRIPTION:A visit to our popular annual Holiday Boutique is a great way to get into a good mood and excited for the holidays. Shop for everyone on your holiday list inside Van Vleck House decorated in sparkly splendor. We will have a variety of local vendors and women-owned businesses participating.\nPublic boutique hours:\nFriday\, Nov. 13\, & Sat. Nov. 14\, 10AM – 6:00 PM\nSunday\, Nov. 15\, 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
