SUMMARY:Taste of Millburn Food Tour
DESCRIPTION:Can you guess how many international cuisines are available in Millburn\, NJ? The number will surprise you. \nFind out for yourself on this VIP tasting tour of Millburn’s world class eateries. On this guided\, 3-hour culinary adventure on Sunday\, November 15\, guests will enjoy exclusive tastings directly from the chefs and restaurant owners that make Millburn an up-and-coming foodie destination. \n“Taste of Millburn” is unlike anything you’ve experienced before\, an action-packed exploration of food\, history\, art\, and more — an extraordinary afternoon of fun\, learning\, and friendship that will leave you wanting to come back… as soon as your appetite returns! \n​This specially curated event is perfect for both visitors and locals who have lived in the area for years. Brought to you in partnership with Explore Millburn-Short Hills. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
